# Contact form delivery.
# Pick ONE provider, put its values in .env.local, then restart the dev server.
#
# ---- Option A: Web3Forms (recommended, free, no account needed) -------------
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com, enter athangkali21@gmail.com, get a key by email.
# 2. Uncomment both lines below and paste the key.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-access-key-here
#
# ---- Option B: Formspree (free tier, 50 submissions a month) ----------------
# 1. Create a form at https://formspree.io, copy its endpoint.
# 2. Uncomment the line below.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
#
# With neither set, the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client.
